This Christmas tree with lights and a glowing star from HOMCOM is a great addition to your festive celebrations and a great focal point in your room. The built-in fibre optic light stays lit when turned on and will create a soft glow around the tree using three colours combination. Made from PVC with a fresh cut look, and with a metal stand to keep your tree firmly secured while in use. It is also designed for years with easy folding and disassembly ready for the next year.

• Pine styled tree stands up tall;
• Made of dense PVC needles with branches with natural look to last all season;
• Pre-lit colourful optical fibre lights expanding the whole tree;
• Includes a star topper attached to the tree adding a festival glow to your home;
• Sturdy foldable metal base provides stability to keep your tree standing firm;
• Easy to assembly and disassemble for storage;
• Perfect for indoor decoration at Christmas, creating festive mood;
• RECOMMENDED SETUP: For the fullest results, work from bottom to top spreading every branch in a spiral motion;
• Item Name: Christmas Tree;
• Brand Name: HOMCOM;
• Material: PVC, Metal Stand;
• Colour: Green;
• Overall Dimension: 4FT: F60x120H (cm). 5FT: F73x150H (cm);
• Branch Tip: 4FT: 130. 5FT: 180;
• Transformer Voltage: 100-240V 50/60Hz;
• Cord Length: 1.8m;
• Power: 3.6W;
• Flat Pack: YES;
• Certification: CE, ROHS;
• Assembly Required: YES;
